## 🧪 Test Types

### web-portal/ Tests
```bash
cd web-portal
npm test                    # Vitest / Jest
npm run lint              # ESLint
npm run type-check        # TypeScript check
```

### service/ Tests (per service) ⭐ MỚI
```bash
# Per service
cd service/service-auth
npm run test:unit             # Jest — mock Consul, mock Prisma
npm run test:integration      # Test containers: Consul + Postgres
npm run test:e2e              # E2E via Gateway
npm run test:cov              # Coverage report

# Shared code — all packages
cd service/shared/common-node && npm run test:cov
cd service/shared/consul-client && npm run test:cov
cd service/shared/circuit-breaker && npm run test:cov
cd service/shared/jwt-utils && npm run test:cov
cd service/shared/error-types && npm run test:cov
cd service/shared/tracing && npm run test:cov
```

### gateway/ Tests ⭐ MỚI
```bash
cd service/gateway
npm run test:unit             # Jest
npm run test:integration      # Integration với mock services
npm run test:cov
```

### app/ Tests (Flutter)
```bash
cd app
flutter test                 # unit + acceptance
flutter test integration_test # e2e thiết bị thật
```

### research/ Tests (Python)
```bash
cd research
pytest                       # all tests
pytest --cov                # with coverage
```

## ✅ MUST
- Mỗi PR phải có test — coverage không giảm
- Test behavior, not implementation
- web-portal/: Vitest/Jest + React Testing Library
- service/: Jest + Supertest + test containers (Consul + Postgres)
- gateway/: Jest + integration tests
- app/: Flutter test + integration_test
- research/: pytest + pytest-cov

## ❌ NEVER
- Skip test không có lý do rõ ràng
- Fake coverage — chỉ test happy path
- Mock toàn bộ Consul — phải test với Consul test container
- Mock toàn bộ database — integration test phải dùng test Postgres container
- Test happy path only — phải test error cases

## 🧪 Microservice Testing Strategy ⭐ MỚI

### Unit Tests
```typescript
// service/service-auth/tests/unit/auth.service.test.ts
import { describe, it, expect, vi } from 'vitest';
import { AuthService } from '../src/services/auth.service';

// Mock Consul — không gọi Consul thật
vi.mock('@service/shared/consul-client', () => ({
  Consul: {
    resolve: vi.fn().mockResolvedValue('http://localhost:3001'),
  },
}));

// Mock Prisma
vi.mock('../src/prisma/client', () => ({
  prisma: {
    user: {
      findUnique: vi.fn(),
      create: vi.fn(),
    },
  },
}));

describe('AuthService', () => {
  it('should verify valid credentials', async () => {
    // Test implementation
  });

  it('should throw AuthError for invalid credentials', async () => {
    // Test implementation
  });
});
```

