## 🎯 Quality Gates ⭐ MỚI

### CI Pipeline
```yaml
# .github/workflows/test.yml
jobs:
  service-tests:
    services:
      postgres:
        image: postgres:15
      consul:
        image: consul:1.15
    steps:
      - name: Run unit tests
        run: npm run test:unit
      - name: Run integration tests
        run: npm run test:integration
      - name: Check coverage
        run: npm run test:cov

  gateway-tests:
    steps:
      - name: Run gateway tests
        run: npm run test
      - name: Check coverage
        run: npm run test:cov

  shared-tests:
    steps:
      - name: Run shared code tests
        run: npm run test
      - name: Check coverage
        run: npm run test:cov

  quality-gate:
    needs: [service-tests, gateway-tests, shared-tests]
    steps:
      - name: Verify coverage thresholds
        run: |
          # Fail if coverage < threshold
          # Per service coverage must be >= 80%
```

